WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:01.920
¿Sabes que?

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:03.040
This is crossing the line.

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:04.000
First, you kidnapped me,

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.040
then you dragged me here.

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:06.240
Now I have to pretend

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:07.360
to be your girlfriend.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:07.960
Shh.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.120
We had a deal.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.480
No unnecessary questions.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:11.760
Just bear with it longer.

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:12.320
Okay?

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:12.840
What?

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:13.840
Are you kidding me?

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:14.880
It's almost Christmas.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.640
My next two weeks are

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:18.640
booked down to the hour.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:20.720
Other people are depending

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:21.840
on me.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:23.520
Do you even care about

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:25.200
anyone but yourself?

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:26.160
Stop talking.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.720
Give me your hand.

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:30.800
Lymphoma means living

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:32.840
in constant fear.

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.520
I know what I'm talking about

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:35.800
as this disease has

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:37.400
knocked on my door too.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:38.600
Michael.

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:43.080
What the hell is this now?

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:44.840
A non-disclosure agreement.

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:46.120
Just sign it if you want

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:47.560
your stuff back.

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:51.600
This will be a cutting-edge lab,

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:52.720
with the brightest minds

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:54.720
in modern medicine working here.

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:56.280
Yes, this year,

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:58.840
the Hendersons are playing Santa!

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:01.320
Let's keep believing in miracles.

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:12.440
You gave in quickly.

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:14.040
How much do I owe you?

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:15.400
I don't want a cent from you.

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:17.480
Just give me back my phone.

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:18.840
Michael.

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:23.800
Okay, bye.

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:25.480
What?

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:26.640
Is your fiancée

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:27.720
is leaving already?

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:30.200
Gina has business

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:31.240
to attend to, dad.

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:32.480
You like it when women

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:33.400
aren't just sitting at home

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:34.720
but actually working.

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:37.080
Gina, I expect to see you

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:38.320
at my house in a week.

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:39.720
I hope you don't work

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:40.760
on Christmas Eve?

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:42.240
Oh, actually, I don't-
